# CDF REST API Endpoints Reference

Base URL: `http://localhost:8080`

---

## Health

| Method | Endpoint  | Auth | Description          |
| ------ | --------- | ---- | -------------------- |
| `GET`  | `/health` | None | Cluster health check |

**Response:**

```json
{ "status": "healthy", "version": "0.1.0" }
```

---

## Authentication

| Method | Endpoint           | Auth    | Description                  |
| ------ | ------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------- |
| `POST` | `/v1/auth/token`   | None    | Login with username/password |
| `POST` | `/v1/auth/refresh` | None    | Refresh access token         |
| `POST` | `/v1/auth/revoke`  | API Key | Revoke a specific token      |

**Login Request:**

```json
{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "secret"
}
```

**Login Response:**

```json
{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
  "refresh_token": "dGhpcyBpcyBhIHJlZnJlc2g...",
  "expires_in": 3600,
  "token_type": "Bearer"
}
```

