## Data Operations

### Insert

| Method | Endpoint           | Auth          | Description          |
| ------ | ------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |
| `POST` | `/v1/insert`       | API Key / JWT | Insert a single row  |
| `POST` | `/v1/batch_insert` | API Key / JWT | Insert multiple rows |

**Insert Request:**

```json
{
  "namespace": "default",
  "table": "papers",
  "data": {
    "title": "Attention Is All You Need",
    "abstract": "We propose a new simple network architecture...",
    "embedding": {
      "model_id": "all-MiniLM-L6-v2",
      "values": [0.1, 0.2, 0.3, ...]
    },
    "year": 2017
  }
}
```

**Insert Response:**

```json
{
  "row_id": "paper-123",
  "status": "inserted"
}
```

### Get / Update / Delete

| Method   | Endpoint                                | Auth          | Description   |
| -------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------- |
| `GET`    | `/v1/rows/{namespace}/{table}/{row_id}` | API Key / JWT | Get row by ID |
| `PUT`    | `/v1/update`                            | API Key / JWT | Update a row  |
| `DELETE` | `/v1/rows/{namespace}/{table}/{row_id}` | API Key / JWT | Delete a row  |

**Update Request:**

```json
{
  "namespace": "default",
  "table": "papers",
  "row_id": "paper-123",
  "data": {
    "title": "Updated Title"
  }
}
```

---

## Query

| Method | Endpoint    | Auth          | Description       |
| ------ | ----------- | ------------- | ----------------- |
| `POST` | `/v1/query` | API Key / JWT | Execute CQL query |

**Request:**

```json
{
  "query": "SELECT title FROM papers WHERE embedding SIMILAR TO :vec WITH THRESHOLD 0.85",
  "params": {
    "vec": [0.1, 0.2, 0.3]
  }
}
```

---

## Vector Search

| Method | Endpoint          | Auth          | Description              |
| ------ | ----------------- | ------------- | ------------------------ |
| `POST` | `/v1/search`      | API Key / JWT | Semantic vector search   |
| `POST` | `/v1/search_text` | API Key / JWT | Text-to-embedding search |

**Vector Search Request:**

```json
{
  "namespace": "default",
  "table": "papers",
  "vector": [0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4],
  "top_k": 5,
  "threshold": 0.85,
  "filter": {
    "year": { "$gt": 2020 }
  }
}
```

**Vector Search Response:**

```json
{
  "results": [
    {
      "row_id": "paper-456",
      "title": "BERT: Pre-training...",
      "score": 0.92
    }
  ]
}
```

**Text Search Request:**

```json
{
  "namespace": "default",
  "table": "papers",
  "text": "transformer architecture",
  "top_k": 5
}
```

---

## Graph Operations

| Method | Endpoint              | Auth          | Description             |
| ------ | --------------------- | ------------- | ----------------------- |
| `POST` | `/v1/graph/edges`     | API Key / JWT | Add a graph edge        |
| `GET`  | `/v1/graph/traverse`  | API Key / JWT | BFS graph traversal     |
| `GET`  | `/v1/graph/neighbors` | API Key / JWT | Get immediate neighbors |

**Add Edge Request:**

```json
{
  "namespace": "default",
  "from_id": "paper-123",
  "to_id": "paper-456",
  "edge_type": "cites",
  "properties": {
    "weight": 1.0,
    "context": "related work"
  }
}
```

**Traverse Request:**

```http
GET /v1/graph/traverse?start_id=paper-123&depth=2&edge_types=cites,references
```

**Traverse Response:**

```json
{
  "paths": [
    {
      "nodes": ["paper-123", "paper-456", "paper-789"],
      "edges": [
        { "from": "paper-123", "to": "paper-456", "type": "cites" },
        { "from": "paper-456", "to": "paper-789", "type": "cites" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

