## Streaming (SSE)

| Method | Endpoint        | Auth          | Description               |
| ------ | --------------- | ------------- | ------------------------- |
| `GET`  | `/v1/subscribe` | API Key / JWT | Server-Sent Events stream |

**Request:**

```http
GET /v1/subscribe?namespace=default&table=papers&events=insert,update
```

**Event Stream:**

```text
event: insert
data: {"row_id": "paper-999", "table": "papers"}

event: update
data: {"row_id": "paper-123", "changes": {"title": "New Title"}}
```

