## Admin APIs

### Users

| Method   | Endpoint                                   | Auth               | Description      |
| -------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------ | ---------------- |
| `POST`   | `/v1/admin/users`                          | SuperAdmin / Admin | Create user      |
| `GET`    | `/v1/admin/users`                          | Admin              | List users       |
| `GET`    | `/v1/admin/users/{user_id}`                | Admin              | Get user details |
| `PUT`    | `/v1/admin/users/{user_id}`                | Admin              | Update user      |
| `DELETE` | `/v1/admin/users/{user_id}`                | Admin              | Delete user      |
| `POST`   | `/v1/admin/users/{user_id}/reset_password` | Admin              | Reset password   |

**Create User Request:**

```json
{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret",
  "roles": ["developer"],
  "namespaces": ["default", "ml"]
}
```

