## Error Responses

| Status | Meaning          | Example Response                                            |
| ------ | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| `400`  | Bad Request      | `{"error": "Invalid vector dimensions"}`                    |
| `401`  | Unauthorized     | `{"error": "Invalid or expired token"}`                     |
| `403`  | Forbidden        | `{"error": "Insufficient permissions for table 'papers'"}`  |
| `404`  | Not Found        | `{"error": "Row 'paper-123' not found"}`                    |
| `422`  | Validation Error | `{"error": "Schema mismatch: expected vector, got scalar"}` |
| `500`  | Internal Error   | `{"error": "Storage node unreachable"}`                     |

